{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17780","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 七 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿德符玄化，芳情翊太和。\n日轮皇鉴远，天仗圣朝多。\n曙色含金牓，晴光转玉珂。\n中宫陈广乐，元老进赓歌。\n莲叶看龟上，桐花识凤过。\n小臣空击壤，沧海是恩波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}